# Agent OpenAPI Files

Any REST endpoint or contract change **must** update the relevant OpenAPI files under `documentation/api/`:

- Agent API: `documentation/api/Agent-API_internal.yaml`
- Admin API: `documentation/api/Admin-API.yaml`, `documentation/api/Admin-API_internal.yaml`

Match existing naming and structure. Do not introduce breaking public API changes without explicit product approval.
